&lt;li&gt;Proven technical experience making websites SEO and AEO-friendly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing data and in dashboards and reporting software such as Tableau, Looker, Adobe Analytics, or Google Analytics to drive growth decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying user intent analysis to prioritize actions that deliver measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
