&lt;li&gt;Guide your team to handle verifications-related user facing escalations and support internal teams with complex inquiries, guiding cross-functional teams on how to navigate network compliance rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strong operational delivery and process improvement helping to maintain risk detection strategies and business rules that balance risk and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
